Day 69 – Ansible Playbooks and Modules

Today I learned the basics of Ansible Playbooks and Modules.

What I Learned

- What is an Ansible Playbook
- Basic Playbook structure
- Play, Task and Module
- "command" module
- YAML-based automation
- Syntax checking of a Playbook

My First Playbook

---
- name: My First Ansible Playbook
  hosts: all
  tasks:
    - name: Check server uptime
      command: uptime

Commands Practiced

ansible-playbook first-playbook.yml --syntax-check

ansible-playbook first-playbook.yml

Key Takeaway

I learned how Ansible Playbooks are structured and how modules are used to perform tasks.

Keeping my learning beginner-friendly and practical before moving to advanced Ansible concepts.

